  "details": "I really miss having lights and sounds on avatars for quest. So me and my friends came up with the idea of adding them back, but having toggles for them in the graphics menu so you can turn them off if ever needed for performance reasons. Like if you don’t want lights on avatars, you can go to the graphics menu and switch off “Avatar lights”. Also like on pc, a volume slider for the avatar sounds too, just incase something is a little too loud. This is just an idea I had and I could see it working! Though its entirely up to you guys, just an idea! Oh also re-add transparency if that’s possible too lol",
